      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A red-skinned predator with two jagged horns coming from its head and a small, spiked tail coming from behind its body. It has a strangely hume-like face. - Imban</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 14, touch 12, flat-footed 12 (+2 Dex, +2 natural)</p><p>hp 16 [30] (3d10)</p><p>Fort +3, Ref +5, Will -1</p><p>Resist fire 10</p><p>Vulnerable water</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 40 ft.</p><p>Melee gore +8 (1d8+4 + 1d6 fire), tail slap +3 (1d6+2 bludgeoning and piercing + 1d6 fire)</p><p>Special Attacks Flare Spike, Leech (1d6+4)</p><p>Special Abilities Mutation</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 18, Dex 14, Con 11, Int 5, Wis 9, Cha 7</p><p>Base Atk +3; CMB +7; CMD 19 (23 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Improved Natural Attack (Gore), Weapon Focus (Gore)</p><p>Skills Climb +7, Perception +3, Stealth +6</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Environment urban ruins</p><p>Organization solitary, pair, or pack (3-5)</p><p>Treasure standard</p>"
